.TH OROC-TOOLING 1 "" "Oro Runtime 0.2.0" "Oro Runtime Manual"
.SH NAME
oroc\-tooling \- Export and prepare editor compilation models.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
oroc tooling <command> [options]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Export and prepare editor compilation models.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBkotlin\fR
export or prepare a Kotlin model
.TP
\fBcpp\fR
export C\-family compiler commands
.TP
\fBtypescript\fR
export web sources and Oro SDK typings
.TP
\fBswift\fR
export commands and prepare Swift modules
.TP
\fBdoctor\fR
inspect editor setup and model freshness
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
show help
.SH NOTES
.PP
Use 'oroc tooling <command> \-\-help' for model export and preparation options.
.PP
Tooling models are JSON. Doctor defaults to readable text and also accepts \-\-json.
.SH SEE ALSO
oroc(1)
